        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hushai ŵamlemwekasisye Abisalomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panyuma pakwe Ahitofelo ŵamsalile Abisalomu kuti, “Mungunde kuti sagule acalume 12,000, mbe nawo pakwakuya Daudi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " cilo cino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tingamtaje ngondo ali apesile soni ali ajasile cikulupi. Ciyikamtesye woga yeleyi, mpaka ŵandu wosope ŵali nawo takatile. Pelepo tingagambe kwawulaga mwenye pewo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni tingayice nawo ŵandu wosope kwa ŵalakwe mpela mwakuwujila mlombela kwa jwamlume jwakwe. Ciwa ca mundu jumo, ticicipeleka mtendele kwa ŵandu wosope.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisalomu ni acakulungwa wosope ŵakulongolela ŵa Aisalaeli yanonyelesye yiyaŵecetedweyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pelepo Abisalomu ŵatite, “Amŵilanje soni Hushai, Mwaliki, kuti tupikane yitaŵecete nombe najo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali ayice Hushai kwa Abisalomu, Abisalomu ŵatite kuti, “Yaŵecete Ahitofelo nayi; ana tutende mpela mwatusalililemo? Naga iyayi atusalile yitutende.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hushai ŵajanjile Abisalomu kuti, “Nambo lelo jino yiŵasalile Ahitofeloyo yili yangalumbana kose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akumanyilila kuti baba ŵawo ni ŵamacili kwabasi atamose soni ŵandu ŵawo ŵamacili, wosope ŵene ali ŵatumbile mpela yimbala ngondo yakusumulidwa ŵanace kwitinji. Konjecesya pelepo, baba ŵenu ali ŵakumanyilila ngondo soni ngaŵa mkugona ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵa ngondo cilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pelepo ajuŵile kumbanga kapena malo gane gakwe gakusisika. Myoyo ŵane mwa ŵandu ŵenu ali awulajidwe mwacitema kundandako, jwalijose jutacipikana taciŵeceta kuti, ŵandu wosope ŵiŵaliji panyuma pa Abisalomu awulajidwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni pelepo atamose mundu jwakulimba mtima mpela lisimba taciŵa jwangali macili soni tacikola woga. Pakuti Aisalaeli wosope akumanyilila kuti baba ŵenu ni ŵamacili konjecesya pelepo ŵandu ŵawo ŵakulimba mtima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nambo une nguti, wosope ŵene Aisalaeli asongane kwa ŵalakwe kutyocela ku Dani mpaka ku Belesheba, taŵe ŵajinji mpela mcenga mungulugulu nyasa. Ni ŵalakwe tajawule nawo ku ngondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano uwe tucimsimana Daudi kulikose kwali, ni tucimtaga ngondo mpela mangame mugakusagwilila pasi posope. Ngasipapagwa atamose mundu jumpepe jwakusigala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga tatilile mu msinda wine, Aisalaeli wosope taciyika ni ngonji ku msindako ni kuwuwutila ku ciŵata, soni kweleko ngasikawoneka atamose kaganga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pelepo Abisalomu ni Aisalaeli wosope ŵatite, “Yatusalile Hushai Mwaliki ni yambone, ngaŵa ya Ahitofelo yila.” Yaliji myoyo ligongo AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵasosile kuti yambone yiŵaŵecete Ahitofelo yikakomboleka kuti Abisalomu yasokonecele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hushai ŵamtetele Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneka Hushai ŵasalile ŵambopesi ŵala Sadoki ni Abiyatala kuti, “Yiŵaŵecete Ahitofelo kwa Abisalomu ni kwa acimlongola ŵa Aisalaeli nayi. Nambo une nasalile jemanjajo ayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni sambano ŵatumicisye utenga mwakwanguya kwasalila kuti Daudi akasagona mcipululu nambo ajomboce Yolodani, kuti ŵelewo pamo ni ŵandu ŵali nawo tacikamulwa ni kuwulajidwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonatani ni Ahimasi ŵaliji mkwembecela pa Enilogeli, pakuŵandikana ni Yelusalemu. Jwamkongwe jwakutumicila ni juŵasalilaga yindu Yonatani ni Ahimasi, jemanjaji ŵajawulaga kukusala kwa Mwenye Daudi. Pakuti jemanjajo nginasosekwa kulolecelwa pakwinjila mu msindamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo lisiku line mcanda jwine ŵaweni, ni ŵasalile Abisalomu. Myoyo Yonatani ni Ahimasi ŵatisile mwakwanguya, ni ŵayice ku nyumba ja mundu jwine ku Bahulimu juŵakwete cisima pa mlango pakwe. Pelepo jemanjajo ŵajinjile mcisimamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pelepo jwamkongwe jwa mundu jula ŵajigele ciwuniko ni ŵawunicile pa cisimapo, ni kwanika tiligu mwamti cisimaco nganiciwonekaga kose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵa ngondo ŵa Abisalomu piŵayice kwa jwamkongwejo ku nyumba kula ŵamwusisye kuti, “Ana mwaweni Ahimasi ni Yonatani pelepa?” Jwamkongwejo ŵajanjile kuti, “Apite pesi lusulo.” Nambo piŵamsosilesosile ni ngasimana, ŵa ngondowo ŵawujilile ku Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵapite ŵa ngondo ŵala, Ahimasi ni Yonatani ŵakopwece mcisima mula. Ni ŵajawile kwasalila Mwenye Daudi kuti, “Atyoce, ajomboce lusulolu mwakwanguya ligongo Ahitofelo ŵatumile ŵandu ŵakwe kuti amtaje ngondo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jijojo Daudi ŵatyosile ni ŵandu ŵiŵaliji nawo, ni ŵajombwece Lusulo lwa Yolodani. Pikwacaga ni kuti ŵandu wosope ali amasile komboka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵayiweni Ahitofelo kuti ŵandu nginatenda yiŵaŵecete yila, ŵakwesile bulu jwakwe ulendo wa ku msinda ŵakumangwakwe. Ni ŵalinganyisye yindu yosope ya m'nyumba mwakwe, piŵamasilepo ŵalitaŵilile. Ni ŵawile ni ŵamsicile mwilembe lwa baba ŵawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵayice ku Mahanaimu. Abisalomu pamo ni ŵandu ŵa Aisalaeli ŵajomboce Yolodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisalomu ŵamŵisile Amasa kuŵa jwakulongolela jwa ngondo m'malo mwa Yowabu. Amasa ŵaliji mwanace jwa mundu jwine lina lyakwe Itila jwakutyocela mwiŵasa lya Ishimaeli, juŵalombele Abigelo, mwanace jwa Nahasi, mlumbugwe jwa Seluya mama ŵawo Yowabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisalaeli pamo ni Abisalomu ŵagonile mcilambo ca Giliyadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
